stateDiagram-v2
    %% Long-running work tracked by tasks/registry.rs. Every change is emitted
    %% as `task:update` (TaskUpdate). Kinds: hardware-scan, efi-build,
    %% recovery-download, usb-flash.
    [*] --> running : TaskRegistry.create(kind)

    running --> running : progress / message update
    running --> completed : work finished
    running --> failed : error returned, or stalled past the kind's threshold
    running --> cancelled : task_cancel(taskId)

    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]

    note right of running
        Commands check their CancellationToken
        between steps and stop child processes
        when it fires.
    end note

    note right of failed
        Terminal states are final: later updates
        for the same task are ignored.
    end note
